    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Pool utilisation",
      "id": 8,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Scoped to the four pool mountpoints rather than all 37 ZFS datasets - every dataset reports nearly the same figure, since its 'size' is its own usage plus the pool's free space, so charting all of them is noise.\n\nZFS performance degrades once a pool passes ~80% full.",
